[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0028","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0054","title":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 2.5i之前的版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者通过向CD命令附加\"/..%20.\"等字符串，可绕过FTP根目录限制，利用路径穿越方式读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞属于典型的\"..\"(点点)攻击变种，影响Serv-U FTP Server 2.4及2.5版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，对系统机密性构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0054"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 至 2.5i 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。鉴于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd），并对 FTP 服务实施网络访问控制和最小权限原则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0043.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97604119024280&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/464","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5639","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20461"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0008","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0021","title":"Endymion MailMan Webmail 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Endymion MailMan Webmail 3.0.25 及更早版本存在任意命令执行漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务的 alternate_template 参数提交包含 shell 元字符的特制请求，在服务器端执行任意系统命令。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入做有效过滤，导致攻击者可直接控制目标服务器，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0021"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 MailMan Webmail 至 3.0.26 或更高版本，该版本已修复通过 alternate_template 参数注入 shell 元字符的问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面对 alternate_template 参数进行输入过滤，禁止包含 |;&$ 等 shell 特殊字符，并限制 Web 服务运行账户的最小权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0057.html","http://www.endymion.com/products/mailman/history.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2063","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5649","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20469"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0390","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0390.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1273","title":"Linux Linux Kernel mxcsr P4 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.17-14 之前版本在特定 Intel CPU 上存在 \"mxcsr P4\" 漏洞，本地用户可通过操作 MXCSR 控制寄存器触发内核异常，导致系统停机拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行在特定 Intel Pentium 4 处理器上的 Linux 内核 2.2.17-14 之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且无需特权，通过执行特制指令序列操作 MXCSR 寄存器触发内核异常导致系统停机，CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属低危本地拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1273"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56.580","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.17-14 或更高版本（如 2.4.x 稳定分支），该版本修复了 Pentium 4 上 mxcsr 寄存器导致的本地拒绝服务漏洞。若无法立即升级内核，可限制本地用户登录权限或通过 GRUB 启动参数添加 `nopentium4` 禁用 Pentium 4 特定优化作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/l-045.shtml","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-013.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1273.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1273","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1273.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1273.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-35mm-49c2-78fg/GHSA-35mm-49c2-78fg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86996/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1273.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Dataset/Dataset/CVE_list.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0390.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0225","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0101","title":"Fetchmail AUTHENTICATE GSSAPI 命令远程代码执行漏洞","description":"fetchmail 5.5.0-2 及更早版本在处理 AUTHENTICATE GSSAPI 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向运行 fetchmail 的邮件服务器发送特制的 GSSAPI 认证请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 fetchmail 5.5.0-2 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0101"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39.420","remediation":"升级 fetchmail 至 5.5.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 AUTHENTICATE GSSAPI 命令中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 fetchmail 配置文件中禁用 GSSAPI 认证方式（设置 `auth ssh` 或 `auth password`），或在防火墙层面限制对 fetchmail 服务端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHBA-2000-106.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-December/000027.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7455","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0101","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0101.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-286v-p4r7-vj8x/GHSA-286v-p4r7-vj8x.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0101.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88415/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--405258fe-ea2c-4dc7-ad29-892c998cb8bf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0223","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0072","title":"GNU GnuPG 从公钥服务器导入私钥未通知用户导致信任链破坏漏洞","description":"GnuPG（gpg）1.0.4 及之前版本在从公钥服务器导入密钥时，未区分公钥和私钥，也未向用户提示存在私钥导入的情况。攻击者可在公钥服务器上发布包含恶意私钥的密钥包，当用户执行密钥导入操作时，私钥被静默导入本地密钥环，从而破坏 OpenPGP 信任链模型。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，远程即可实施，影响所有使用 GnuPG 进行密钥管理的用户。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0072"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36.220","remediation":"升级 GnuPG 至 1.0.5 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 2.4.x），该漏洞已在 1.0.5 中修复，导入密钥时会提示用户注意私钥。如无法升级，使用 `gpg --import --import-options import-clean` 导入密钥，并在导入后执行 `gpg --list-secret-keys` 检查是否有意外私钥被导入，及时删除。避免从不可信的公开密钥服务器直接导入密钥包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000368","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001225b","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/2000/MDKSA-2000-087.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/1702","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-131.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152197","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2153","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0072","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0072.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0072.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7774-m57j-3qmq/GHSA-7774-m57j-3qmq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5585c9c3-f992-4e68-a4db-f7048a50dab2.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-087.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0072.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0223.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0221","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0071","title":"GnuPG 分离签名验证绕过漏洞","description":"GnuPG（GPG）1.0.4 及之前版本在处理分离签名时存在签名验证缺陷，未能正确校验分离签名的有效性，导致攻击者可在不触发任何告警的情况下篡改文件内容。该漏洞为本地攻击向量，攻击者需具备对目标文件的写入权限，利用方式为替换已签名文件及其分离签名文件，使接收方误认为篡改后的文件仍来自可信来源。受影响版本包括 GnuPG 1.0.4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0071"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36.093","remediation":"升级 GnuPG 至 1.0.4b 或更高版本。Debian 用户运行 `apt-get update && apt-get install gnupg`，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000-131 提供的更新包。如无法升级，在验证分离签名时手动检查文件哈希值并与签名中的哈希比对，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000368","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001225b","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/2000/MDKSA-2000-087.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/1699","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-131.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152197","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2141","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5802","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0071","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0071.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0071.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7jj-pm2f-3h96/GHSA-r7jj-pm2f-3h96.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--af807610-1af8-4590-9ddc-f2f17638ae9a.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-087.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0071.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0221.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0217","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0060","title":"stunnel stunnel 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"stunnel 3.8 及更早版本中存在格式化字符串漏洞。stunnel 是一款 SSL 加密隧道代理，用于将非加密的网络流量封装在 SSL 通道中。该漏洞存在于 stunnel 处理 ident 协议用户名的方式中，当 stunnel 接收到特制的 ident 用户名时，会将其作为格式化字符串参数传递给 printf 类函数，导致攻击者可以通过精心构造的 ident 用户名触发格式化字符串漏洞，从而执行任意代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，且利用复杂度较低，可完全控制目标系统。受影响的版本包括 stunnel 3.8 及所有更早版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0060"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34.827","remediation":"立即升级 stunnel 至 3.9 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ident 用户名格式化字符串漏洞。如无法升级，可在 stunnel 配置中禁用 ident 协议支持（设置 ident = no），并在网络层面限制对 stunnel 端口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0337.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000363","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-009","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-129.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/151719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2128","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5807","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0060.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0060","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0060.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cpcw-2gx9-xcwx/GHSA-cpcw-2gx9-xcwx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bdf0e763-6f0b-463e-a842-51b225af211e.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/deb_009_1.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0060.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0213","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0213.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0013","title":"ISC BIND 4 nslookupComplain 格式字符串漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 4 域名服务器软件的 nslookupComplain 函数存在格式字符串漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制的格式字符串数据包，触发该函数中的格式化输出缺陷，导致攻击者可以覆盖任意内存地址，最终以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BIND 4 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，可导致服务器完全被控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0013"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29.393","remediation":"立即将 BIND 4 升级至 BIND 9.x 系列最新稳定版（如 BIND 9.18.x），BIND 4 已停止维护且存在多处严重漏洞。如无法升级，在 named.conf 中限制 nslookup 功能访问来源，仅允许受信 IP 段发起 DNS 查询请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http:/