aliases":["CVE-2001-0012"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29.280","remediation":"升级 BIND 4 至 4.9.7 及以上版本，或 BIND 8 至 8.2.3 及以上版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-026 提供的更新包；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2001-007 提供的更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙限制对 DNS 服务器的非授权访问，并禁用递归查询以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-026","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2321","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0012.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0012.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0012","https://github.com/inverse-inc/packetfence/blob/e3d449fa3dffae7114371a08a62277ed31dc7111/conf/nexpose-responses.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0012.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0012.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mw37-2wq7-83rg/GHSA-mw37-2wq7-83rg.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-026.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/B/bind_covert_overflows.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0210.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0210.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0208","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0011","title":"ISC BIND 4 nslookupComplain 函数缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"BIND 4 的 nslookupComplain 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制的查询请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致 root 权限获取，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 BIND 4 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至 BIND 8 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0011"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29.170","remediation":"立即升级至 BIND 9.x 或更高版本，BIND 4 已停止维护且不再接收安全更新。如无法升级，在防火墙规则中限制对 DNS 服务器的递归查询来源 IP，仅允许可信网络段访问，并禁用 nslookup 组件的非必要功能以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2307","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0011.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0011.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0011","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0011.json","https://github.com/tomhart-msc/verisec/blob/02f3a9660885181705e7550b8609534bbbaa414c/programs/apps/bind/CVE-2001-0011/README","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0011.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/B/bind_covert_overflows.nasl","https://github.com/westtide/open-source-case-studies/blob/57e71842cdb3e034316b0d083f8d19f680501b67/verisec/programs/apps/bind/CVE-2001-0011/README","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0043","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0100","title":"Brian Stanback bslist.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Brian Stanback 开发的 bslist.cgi 邮件列表脚本存在命令注入漏洞。该 CGI 程序在处理用户提交的电子邮件地址参数时，未对 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符、反引号等）进行有效过滤或转义，导致远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 email 字段中注入恶意系统命令，从而在服务器端以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 bslist.cgi 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0100"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39.317","remediation":"立即停止使用 bslist.cgi 1.0 或更高版本，该脚本已无官方维护；如业务必需，应彻底删除或禁用该 CGI 脚本，改用现代邮件列表软件（如 Mailman 3、Sympa）。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器配置中对 email 参数添加输入过滤规则，拦截 shell 元字符（; | ` $ 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0390.html","http://www.stanback.net/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5797","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20525","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0100","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0100.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0100.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c3